一、站点性质 / Nature of the Site
--------------------------------------------------------------------
本网站是一个公开的、非商业的艺术欣赏与个人作品集站点，面向所有
访问者开放浏览，并允许搜索引擎正常收录其内容。本站不含任何广告、
付费墙或商业性利用。

This is a public, non-commercial art-appreciation and personal
portfolio site. It is open to all visitors and is intended to be
indexed by search engines. It carries no advertising, paywall, or
commercial exploitation.

